    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/e3ab0330ebb561a7f774c1ad9b81fac9.avif?t=1581707786\" /></div><br><strong>A story-driven body-horror simulator where you can\u2019t kill your enemies but you can distort their bodies in creepy ways. Grow lumps, build weird living structures and dive into the dark mysteries of Zheltikov\u2019s military base.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/25b5319f75c57ead7df0e0ba498b5536.poster.avif?t=1581707786\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/25b5319f75c57ead7df0e0ba498b5536.webm?t=1581707786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/25b5319f75c57ead7df0e0ba498b5536.mp4?t=1581707786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/479f55126cb78fb31da49fad11749fab.avif?t=1581707786\" /></div><br>Zheltikov is a scientific-military base dedicated to the study of the volcano of the same name. The facility has grown like a huge and distorted creature in the surroundings of the mountain... And even inside! Different experiments related to Zheltikov\u2019s unique lava were conducted across the base, including some tests focusing on the correlation between geological phenomena and the human psyche\u2026 And then the volcano erupted.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/ca282146d77a7a57084dbed8d41db9eb.poster.avif?t=1581707786\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/ca282146d77a7a57084dbed8d41db9eb.webm?t=1581707786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/ca282146d77a7a57084dbed8d41db9eb.mp4?t=1581707786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/2663a8b8c926d4e54ed05d3c64a670d4.avif?t=1581707786\" /></div><br><i>Featuring:</i><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li>A semi open world fps adventure with quests, side quests and environmental puzzles.<br></li><li>Discover different types of ways of distorting enemies bodies: sticky lumps, heavy lumps, floating lumps and more!<br></li><li>Communicate to a wide variety of characters, examine different objects and draw your own conclusions in a dark and rich narrative world.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/c2edc576907e0355ecc5e49f1a395321.poster.avif?t=1581707786\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/c2edc576907e0355ecc5e49f1a395321.webm?t=1581707786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/c2edc576907e0355ecc5e49f1a395321.mp4?t=1581707786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i>Note: <br>Game is currently under development. All gameplay clips and screenshots shown above are from an early pre-alpha build.</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/e3ab0330ebb561a7f774c1ad9b81fac9.avif?t=1581707786\" /></div><br><strong>A story-driven body-horror simulator where you can\u2019t kill your enemies but you can distort their bodies in creepy ways. Grow lumps, build weird living structures and dive into the dark mysteries of Zheltikov\u2019s military base.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/25b5319f75c57ead7df0e0ba498b5536.poster.avif?t=1581707786\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/25b5319f75c57ead7df0e0ba498b5536.webm?t=1581707786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/25b5319f75c57ead7df0e0ba498b5536.mp4?t=1581707786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/479f55126cb78fb31da49fad11749fab.avif?t=1581707786\" /></div><br>Zheltikov is a scientific-military base dedicated to the study of the volcano of the same name. The facility has grown like a huge and distorted creature in the surroundings of the mountain... And even inside! Different experiments related to Zheltikov\u2019s unique lava were conducted across the base, including some tests focusing on the correlation between geological phenomena and the human psyche\u2026 And then the volcano erupted.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/ca282146d77a7a57084dbed8d41db9eb.poster.avif?t=1581707786\" ><source src=\"https://shared.aka